238	  /* Shared headline treatment for every big Redaction-35 title on the site
239	     (home page's "Hi, I'm Cody", blog post titles, case-study titles).
240	     font-size is plain CSS, not a Tailwind arbitrary value — Tailwind v4's
241	     arbitrary-value parser can't handle the commas inside clamp(), even
242	     backslash-escaped, and silently drops the whole class instead of
243	     erroring. clamp() scales the size smoothly from 64px on small screens
244	     up to 80px, rather than snapping at a single breakpoint the way the
245	     home page's old text-[56px] sm:text-[80px] did — the 3vw term hits the
246	     64px floor around a 533px-wide viewport and the 80px ceiling around
247	     1067px, transitioning linearly in between. */
